  "section_notes": "S1 imposes strict all-incident reporting and fast customer notice. S2 sets 55°C/5% but allows continued marketing above the limit pending corrective action, so it is weakened. S3 accepts a 6-year retrofit, S4 a 36-month suppression deadline, and S5 a mandatory recall at 8/100k with prompt notices."
